command: cargo run --quiet -- play --help
---
Run a marionette-style discovery scene

Usage: keel play [OPTIONS] [BEARING]

Arguments:
  [BEARING]  Bearing ID to cast in a discovery scenario

Options:
      --prop <prop>        Start with a specific prop in hand
      --theater            Launch the theater runtime and render the scene setup
      --theme <theme>      Select a theater theme (for example: drama, comedy, action)
      --persona <persona>  Select a theater persona (for example: neutral, standup, shakespeare)
      --cross <id1> <id2>  Cross two bearings in one paired scene
      --list-props         List available props and marionette functions by category
      --suggest <suggest>  Suggest a mask for a bearing based on its content
  -h, --help               Print help

Examples:
  keel play --theater --theme drama
  keel play --theater --theme comedy --persona standup
  keel play --theater VDlzABC123
  keel play VDlzABC123 --prop bard
  keel play --cross VDlzABC123 VDlzDEF456
